    "fragility_factors": [
      "The link from Engineering Capacity to Total Cost of Ownership could flip which option more runs support."
    ]
  },
  "readiness_rationale": "Two gaps still hold this back: Engineering Capacity is asserted rather than evidenced, and Vendor Price Path carries moderate confidence, so the comparison is not yet settled enough to act on.",
